{
  "feature": "Social R1 PR D: the friend request card at /friend/[token] (handoff design_handoff_the99_social_r1 R2, boards R2 - Landing-Desktop and R2 - Landing-Phone, L2 to L7; plan 2026-10-15-social-r1.md, PR D)",
  "note": "Needs SOCIAL_FRIENDS_ENABLED=true for the reader and the fixture links named in the rows: inviters Ana (Atraxa), Jo Bloggs (no commander), Bob (Korvold, a friend since 2026-10-02) and Cy, and the signed-in account's own link. The L6, L7 and Accept rows WRITE (opening a friend's link spends it; Decline and Accept spend theirs, and Accept writes a friendship), so each width has its own link: run the sheet on a scratch branch off local-dev ONLY, never on local-dev, staging or production. L1 (signed out) is photographed by hand, since the sheet signs in; L8 (a write that throws) and the switch-off state are held by the component and route tests.",
  "shares": {
    "module": "src/components/social/social-toast.tsx",
    "binding": "SocialToast",
    "note": "A failed accept or decline is the social screens' one toast (E15), the same component /friends draws its refusals with."
  },
  "out": "contact-sheets/social-r1-landing",
